{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"利未记","commonName":"利未记","title":"利未记","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"abbbb926c1738f9da414cb45cd4d355517a03ac1f9d5f16d4bb017234cba6bbc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":856},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["献素祭的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“如果有人献素祭给耶和华，要用细面粉作祭物。要在细面粉上浇油、加乳香，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["带到做祭司的亚伦子孙那里。祭司要抓一把浇了油的细面粉，连同所有乳香放在坛上焚烧，作为象征。这是蒙耶和华悦纳的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["剩下的素祭要归亚伦及其子孙，这在献给耶和华的火祭中是至圣之物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“如果献用炉子烤的素祭，要献调油的无酵细面饼，或涂油的无酵薄饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“如果献用平底锅烤的素祭，要献调油的无酵细面饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["要把饼掰成碎块，浇上油。这是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["“如果献用煎锅煎的素祭，要献用细面粉和油做的祭物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["“要把这样做好的素祭带到耶和华面前，交给祭司献在祭坛上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祭司要从中取出一部分，作为象征放在祭坛上焚烧。这是蒙耶和华悦纳的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["剩下的素祭要归亚伦及其子孙。这在献给耶和华的火祭中是至圣之物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["“献给耶和华的任何素祭都不可含酵，因为你们不可把酵或蜜当作火祭献给耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们可以把酵和蜜作为初熟之祭献给耶和华，但不可作为馨香之祭献在祭坛上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所有素祭都要用盐调味，不可少了你们与上帝立约的盐。所有祭物中都要放盐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["“如果将初熟的谷物献给耶和华作素祭，要用烘好后压碎的新麦穗，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["加上油和乳香。这是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["祭司要将一些压碎的麦穗、油及所有乳香作为象征焚烧。这是献给耶和华的火祭。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}